# Environment variable template — CDC Lab Accounts & Asset Management System
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in real local values.
# Never commit real secrets. NFR-MNT-02 requires every variable the app reads
# to be listed here, even if it doesn't yet have real behavior wired to it.
#
# Phase 0 status: only DATABASE_URL is actually read (by the Prisma CLI, for
# schema validation/formatting — no models exist yet, so no live database
# connection is required to run `npx prisma validate` / `npx prisma format`).
# Additional variables (Better Auth session secret/base URL, etc.) will be
# added here in the phase that actually configures each feature — see
# docs/PROJECT_PLAN.md — rather than guessed ahead of time.

# PostgreSQL connection string used by Prisma.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://cdc_dev:cdc_dev_password@localhost:5432/cdc_lab_accounts?schema=public"
